cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Afandem, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Afandem: a benchmark for tool-using LLM agents in Egyptian Arabic, Arabizi and code-switched Arabic"
abstract: >-
  Afandem is an open benchmark for tool-using LLM agents in Arabic. It writes the
  same request in English, Modern Standard Arabic, Egyptian Arabic, Arabizi and
  code-switched Egyptian-English, runs it in deterministic tool sandboxes, and scores
  the end state, the tool calls, their arguments and the refusals, so that a
  difference in what the agent does can be attributed to the language variety.
